  "body": "* Land value only opportunity in sought after Milford\r\n* Vendor prepared to convert cross lease to fee simple prior to settlement\r\n* Three bedrooms, 2.5 bathrooms and spacious living areas\r\n* Converted double garage offering versatile additional space\r\n* Close to Milford Beach, Milford Village, shops, cafés and schools\r\n\r\nLAND VALUE ONLY! UNLOCK THE POTENTIAL IN PRIME MILFORD!\r\n\r\nAn opportunity to secure a property in one of the North Shore's most desirable coastal neighbourhoods, with the focus firmly on land value, location and future possibilities.\r\n\r\nThis property is being marketed and sold on a LAND VALUE ONLY basis, presenting an opportunity for buyers looking to secure a foothold in sought after Milford.\r\n\r\nCurrently held under a cross lease title, the vendor is prepared to convert the title to fee simple prior to settlement, subject to the necessary approvals and completion requirements. This adds another important dimension for purchasers considering the property's future.\r\n\r\nThe existing home offers three spacious bedrooms, 2.5 bathrooms and comfortable open living and dining areas. A converted double garage provides additional multipurpose space, offering flexibility for a range of uses.\r\n\r\nWhile the property is being offered on a land value basis, the existing accommodation provides buyers with a clear picture of what is currently on site as they consider their next steps.\r\n\r\nLOCATION THAT SPEAKS FOR ITSELF\r\n\r\nEnjoy the lifestyle advantages of this established Milford address, with Milford Beach, Milford Village, shopping, cafés, restaurants, schools and everyday amenities all within easy reach.\r\n\r\nWhether your vision involves creating a new home or exploring other possibilities for the site, this is your chance to investigate the potential of a well located Milford property. Purchasers are encouraged to complete their own due diligence regarding any proposed future use.\r\n\r\nTHE LAND IS THE OPPORTUNITY. THE LOCATION IS ESTABLISHED. THE VENDOR IS PREPARED TO CONVERT TO FEE SIMPLE.\r\n\r\nWith land value firmly at the centre of this offering, now is the time to explore what 7A Otakau Road could offer.\r\n\r\nContact Hattie Liu today for further information and arrange your viewing. Don't miss the chance to investigate this Milford opportunity!",
